  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Informative\r\nThe drawings submitted with the application fail to provide an accurate representation of the existing side dormer extension, specifically drawing No.100/07 is inaccurate in terms of the dormer's design and scale. For any subsequent application to be considered accurate plans would be required.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - 1.\tThe proposal, by reason of its excessive size, bulk, appearance and design, would be disproportionately large in relation to the roof and constitute an obtrusive feature which would be out of character and harmful to the original house and the Wood Lane street scene contrary to policies ENV-B 1.1 and H 6.4 of the adopted Unitary Development Plan and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines."
